## Why This Is Asked
This question probes design for governance in KCNA, focusing on isolation, performance, and auditing in a multi-tenant streaming pipeline.

## Key Concepts
- Tenant isolation and per-tenant quotas
- Ingestion-time enforcement and back-pressure
- Retention policies and per-tenant TTL
- Tamper-evident audits and event-based violations

## Code Example
